WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:10.770
Request from Ichigo... when watching the television, sit a safe distance from the television in a well-lit room.

00:00:05.170 --> 00:00:07.050
I'm going to get a failing grade at this rate!

00:00:07.510 --> 00:00:09.680
It's too early to give up!

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:13.350
You've always somehow made it when you were in a pinch!

00:00:12.020 --> 00:00:16.790
closed captions

00:00:13.350 --> 00:00:20.380
You're right. I'm so lucky that I got into the A-group too. Maybe I'll somehow squeeze through!

00:00:20.380 --> 00:00:21.630
You won't.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:23.840
Kashino!

00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:27.300
The test isn't so easy that going with your gut or getting lucky will let you squeeze through.

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:33.750
Just saying, but if you get failing marks, then the total score of the A-group gets a deduction too.

00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:35.470
You have a lot of responsibility.

00:00:35.470 --> 00:00:39.620
I-I know that! Besides, you say that but how are you doing, huh?

00:00:39.620 --> 00:00:41.480
Kashino's always been in top, didn't you know?

00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:42.230
Eh?

00:00:42.650 --> 00:00:45.590
Since he came here he's defended his position perfectly.

00:00:47.190 --> 00:00:51.040
Work hard, so you don't pull me down with you.

00:00:51.040 --> 00:00:55.920
You're such a sadist Kashino! Stop putting extra pressure on m-!

00:00:55.920 --> 00:00:57.080
Ichigo-chan!

00:00:57.360 --> 00:01:00.720
What... Amano!

