Good morning. Yumeiro Pâtissière is brought to you by Konami and these other sponsors.

00:02:41.540 --> 00:02:43.090
Excuse us!

00:02:43.740 --> 00:02:44.730
Amano-san!

00:02:44.730 --> 00:02:46.430
Andou-kun, Hanabusa-kun..!

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:49.120
We heard you fell down the stairs, Amano-san...

00:02:49.120 --> 00:02:50.140
Are you okay?

00:02:50.140 --> 00:02:53.390
I'm fine, I'm fine, it's just a scratch.

00:02:53.390 --> 00:02:55.320
Besides, I'm used to falling down the stairs.

00:02:55.600 --> 00:02:57.880
Have you fallen so much that you've gotten used to it..?

00:02:57.880 --> 00:02:59.860
Anyway, we're glad you're okay.

00:02:59.860 --> 00:03:02.700
Geez, she causes so much trouble.

00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:04.580
Oh, but Kashino-kun, you also...

00:03:04.580 --> 00:03:07.080
Sensei, Amano, she...!

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:10.160
That was the first time I've seen you in such a hurry.

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:11.960
S-Sensei..!

00:03:11.960 --> 00:03:17.130
But, Amano-san, you did hit your head right? Then you should have it checked at the hospital.

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:20.070
No, going to the hospital? That's a little overboard.

00:03:20.070 --> 00:03:23.390
No, you should go. If something were wrong that wouldn't be good.

00:03:23.390 --> 00:03:29.890
Teacher, we're in A-group as well...
We'll escort Amano-san to the hospital.

00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:34.800
Really? Then I guess I'll ask you guys to do that. After all, with Kashino-kun you'll be all right.

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:38.530
With Kashino? Why?

00:03:38.540 --> 00:03:44.520
recipe 18

00:03:38.540 --> 00:03:44.520
The Kashino's Bitter Circumstances

00:03:44.830 --> 00:03:47.990
Sorry guys... and right before a test, too...

00:03:47.990 --> 00:03:49.790
If you're sorry, then be more careful.

00:03:49.790 --> 00:03:50.250
Hmph!

00:03:50.520 --> 00:03:53.420
Geez, why is he always like this?

00:03:53.420 --> 00:03:57.250
It's such a bother when there's a clumsy person in your group!

00:03:57.250 --> 00:04:01.340
It makes me sick when there's a insult-spitting Spirit in my group!

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:02.470
What did you say!?

00:04:02.470 --> 00:04:03.840
What!

00:04:03.840 --> 00:04:05.220
You Vanilla Boo-chan!

00:04:03.840 --> 00:04:07.700
Ah, gosh, both of you stop fighting!

00:04:05.220 --> 00:04:06.400
I'm not a Boo-chan!

00:04:06.400 --> 00:04:07.700
Boo Boo Cushion!

00:04:07.700 --> 00:04:08.390
Calm down.

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:14.450
Whoa... that's a really nice hospital.

00:04:14.450 --> 00:04:17.260
It's the largest hospital around here.

00:04:17.260 --> 00:04:20.070
Andou, Hanabusa. I...

00:04:20.070 --> 00:04:23.150
We know. Kashino, just wait here.

00:04:23.150 --> 00:04:25.070
Well then Ichigo-chan, let's go.

00:04:25.070 --> 00:04:25.710
Huh?

00:04:27.240 --> 00:04:28.780
Why?

00:04:28.780 --> 00:04:30.490
If you go in the hospital you'll understand.

00:04:33.870 --> 00:04:36.250
Hey, why's Kashino-

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:37.610
Yes? What is it?

00:04:37.610 --> 00:04:38.380
Eh?

00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:40.580
Didn't you just call me?

00:04:40.600 --> 00:04:42.080
Kashino General Hospital

00:04:40.600 --> 00:04:42.080
Plastic Surgeon

00:04:40.600 --> 00:04:42.080
Kashino   Yuuya

00:04:40.780 --> 00:04:46.130
Huh, Kashino-san!? I'm sorry, I was talking about a different Kashino-san...

00:04:46.810 --> 00:04:51.770
Really. Well, there are a lot of Kashino's in this hospital. Have a nice day.

00:04:51.770 --> 00:04:55.190
What a weird hospital to have a lot of Kashino's.

00:04:55.190 --> 00:04:57.720
I don't think it's on the level of "a lot".

00:04:57.720 --> 00:04:59.480
Kashino-sensei!

00:04:59.480 --> 00:05:00.520
Yes?

00:05:00.520 --> 00:05:01.400
Eh?

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:04.740
I'm sorry, it's nothing!

00:05:04.740 --> 00:05:05.860
See?

00:05:05.860 --> 00:05:08.530
W-Why's this place so full of Kashino's?

00:05:08.530 --> 00:05:09.490
Actually...

00:05:11.420 --> 00:05:14.500
Director Kashino has arrived.

00:05:23.510 --> 00:05:25.010
What was that?

00:05:25.010 --> 00:05:26.970
That's Kashino's father.

00:05:26.970 --> 00:05:27.720
Eh?

00:05:27.720 --> 00:05:33.720
This place, Kashino General Hospital is a hospital run by the Kashino family.

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:40.490
Whaaaat!? The whole family... wait, Kashino's the son of a doctor?

00:05:40.490 --> 00:05:43.030
Amano-san, Amano Ichigo-san.

00:05:43.030 --> 00:05:44.150
Y-Yes!

00:05:46.750 --> 00:05:48.480
Excuse me...

00:05:48.480 --> 00:05:49.280
Come in.

00:05:49.550 --> 00:05:51.990
Okay, nice to meet you.

00:05:52.670 --> 00:05:55.850
She's a woman doctor, she's so pretty...

00:05:55.850 --> 00:05:57.290
What's wrong?

00:05:57.290 --> 00:06:00.540
Umm, I fell from the stairs and hit my head, so...

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:02.290
Let me see it for just a second.

00:06:02.290 --> 00:06:03.960
Kashino General Hospital

00:06:02.290 --> 00:06:03.960
General Treatment

00:06:02.290 --> 00:06:03.960
Kashino      Rei

00:06:02.290 --> 00:06:06.440
This person is also a Kashino... this place really is full of Kashino's...

00:06:06.440 --> 00:06:07.970
All right.

00:06:08.310 --> 00:06:09.340
Hmm?

00:06:11.510 --> 00:06:13.670
Could this person be...?

00:06:14.150 --> 00:06:19.770
There doesn't seem to be anything out of the ordinary. But just in case, let's take an MRI.

00:06:20.450 --> 00:06:21.690
Lead her there.

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:23.680
General Hospital

00:06:25.200 --> 00:06:28.270
Kashino, what are you thinking about?

00:06:28.270 --> 00:06:29.400
Nothing much.

00:06:31.090 --> 00:06:32.150
General Hospital

00:06:38.170 --> 00:06:41.560
Kashino, sit there for just a moment!

00:06:41.560 --> 00:06:42.770
I'm already sitting.

00:06:43.470 --> 00:06:46.590
What am I to you!?

00:06:46.590 --> 00:06:47.910
What are you..?

00:06:48.820 --> 00:06:49.970
I wonder what.

00:06:50.380 --> 00:06:54.680
Your partner! If you've got an issue then you should consult your partner-!

00:07:01.150 --> 00:07:03.060
It's been a while, Makoto.

00:07:03.060 --> 00:07:04.060
Wha-!

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:06.070
Sis!

00:07:06.070 --> 00:07:08.110
Eh? Kashino's older sister?

00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:12.570
It's quite a rarity for you to come back of your own accord.

00:07:12.570 --> 00:07:17.150
I didn't come back. I'm only here because a classmate's getting checked out.

00:07:17.150 --> 00:07:24.290
Father and Mother are saying they'll be back late tonight again. Let's have a nice chat, sibling to sibling.

00:07:24.290 --> 00:07:24.790
I-!

00:07:25.090 --> 00:07:27.290
We're going to chat. Understood?

00:07:29.560 --> 00:07:30.720
Muraoka.

00:07:30.720 --> 00:07:31.220
Yes'm!

00:07:34.230 --> 00:07:35.350
Let me go!

00:07:35.350 --> 00:07:38.520
A younger brother shouldn't go against his older sister.

00:07:39.980 --> 00:07:42.060
Muraoka, carry him.

00:07:42.060 --> 00:07:44.060
But, is it okay?

00:07:44.530 --> 00:07:49.230
I'm this child's older sister. I have something I must say to him as his older sister.

00:07:49.550 --> 00:07:51.150
Understood.

00:07:54.410 --> 00:07:56.580
Let go of Kashino!

00:08:00.590 --> 00:08:03.460
No... It's useless...

00:08:05.010 --> 00:08:06.840
Kashinooo!

00:08:08.010 --> 00:08:12.510
There's nothing wrong. It's all right, you're fine.

00:08:12.510 --> 00:08:13.720
Stare...

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:14.590
Something wrong?

00:08:14.590 --> 00:08:16.170
You <i>do</i> look similar...

00:08:16.170 --> 00:08:21.770
Umm, could you be Kashino's, no, Kashino Makoto-kun's mother?

00:08:22.400 --> 00:08:23.940
Well yes...

00:08:23.940 --> 00:08:24.770
I knew it!

00:08:24.770 --> 00:08:28.980
I'm in the same group as Kashino-kun at the St. Marie Academy!

00:08:29.570 --> 00:08:32.190
We're working hard on making sweets!

00:08:32.190 --> 00:08:33.150
Pointless...

00:08:33.150 --> 00:08:33.780
Eh?

00:08:34.370 --> 00:08:40.740
What could that child be thinking, spending valuable study time on simply making candy...

00:08:41.210 --> 00:08:48.000
Please tell Makoto to throw away his stupid dream of becoming a pâtissier, and to come back to the Kashino lineage.

00:08:48.840 --> 00:08:50.500
What the heck is she!

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:55.720
Why is it bad to want to become a pâtissier!? She's insulting the art of making sweets!

00:08:55.720 --> 00:08:58.430
Whoa, whoa, calm down Amano-san, all right, Amano-san?

00:08:58.430 --> 00:09:00.510
How can I stay calm!?

00:09:02.190 --> 00:09:08.490
Well, it's no use. The whole family is against Kashino wanting to become a pâtissier.

00:09:08.490 --> 00:09:09.940
Against it?

00:09:10.420 --> 00:09:11.530
Why?

00:09:11.530 --> 00:09:16.090
The Kashino lineage has always been that of doctors.

00:09:16.090 --> 00:09:23.030
His parents and relatives are all doctors. Apparently he's been told to become one since he was young, too.

00:09:23.460 --> 00:09:28.920
His parents bitterly gave one condition, and allowed him to enter St. Marie's Academy.

00:09:28.920 --> 00:09:29.750
A condition?

00:09:29.750 --> 00:09:34.090
It's to stay in first place in grades the whole time, until he graduates.

00:09:34.090 --> 00:09:38.260
If he falls even once from first place, then Kashino's leaving.

00:09:38.260 --> 00:09:39.510
Leaving!?

00:09:39.780 --> 00:09:44.770
So that's why Kashino's more diligent than anybody else, in studying or making sweets.

00:09:44.770 --> 00:09:53.780
I will become a first-class pâtissier and hold a first-class store, for sure. That's why I will leave here in first place as well. I have to.

00:09:53.780 --> 00:09:56.700
So that wasn't just his will.

00:09:56.700 --> 00:09:57.990
We're in trouble!

00:09:57.990 --> 00:10:01.030
Kashino, he got kidnapped!

00:10:01.030 --> 00:10:02.240
What!?

00:10:03.830 --> 00:10:05.870
Hey, stop this at once.

00:10:05.870 --> 00:10:09.330
My, what a scary face. Smile, smile!

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:12.840
Who would smile in this situation? Untie me already!

00:10:12.840 --> 00:10:18.220
But you'll run away. Let's talk nice and slow, it's been a while.

00:10:18.220 --> 00:10:20.090
I don't have anything to say!

00:10:21.480 --> 00:10:29.060
So you're saying you can't listen to what I say. I guess I'll have to punish the bad child who won't listen to me.

00:10:31.700 --> 00:10:33.890
STOP!!!

00:10:44.840 --> 00:10:46.120
We're almost there!

00:10:46.120 --> 00:10:49.500
But, why would he be kidnapped by his older sister?

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:52.830
Kashino didn't seem to be on good terms with his sister, either.

00:10:53.300 --> 00:10:55.750
Kashino's family has got a lot of problems.

00:10:56.890 --> 00:10:58.340
It's here!

00:10:59.430 --> 00:11:00.340
IT'S HUGE!

00:11:03.690 --> 00:11:05.350
You really don't listen, do you?

00:11:05.350 --> 00:11:09.020
I'm going to become a pâtissier, just like that man in Paris!

00:11:09.650 --> 00:11:11.510
Ah, the chocolatier.

00:11:11.990 --> 00:11:16.190
I do remember that you went to play at his store a lot.

00:11:16.740 --> 00:11:20.590
That person could do whatever he wanted because he was adopted as a husband.

00:11:20.590 --> 00:11:24.990
But you're the Kashino lineage's first-born son.
It's your destiny to be a doctor.

00:11:24.990 --> 00:11:27.150
I'll choose my own fate!

00:11:27.750 --> 00:11:29.370
So stubborn...

00:11:29.840 --> 00:11:31.710
Since you're such a bad child...

00:11:34.430 --> 00:11:36.040
S-Sto-!

00:11:36.970 --> 00:11:40.510
You've been so weak to tickling ever since you were little.

00:11:40.970 --> 00:11:45.220
If you want me to stop then say it, say "I'll stop trying to become a pâtissier!"

00:11:45.220 --> 00:11:46.970
N-No!

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:48.220
Say it!

00:11:48.650 --> 00:11:51.890
We'll probably be flicked away if we head straight-on.

00:11:51.890 --> 00:11:58.650
I bet there's a security system in the grounds. I think we should ask the Spirits to look inside...

00:11:58.650 --> 00:12:01.240
Hanabusa-kuun, Andou-kuun~

00:12:01.550 --> 00:12:02.950
Over here, over here!

00:12:02.950 --> 00:12:04.140
Whoa, Ichigo-chan!?

00:12:04.140 --> 00:12:04.820
That's dangerous!

00:12:04.820 --> 00:12:06.200
I'm fine, I'm fine.

00:12:10.580 --> 00:12:12.120
Oww...

00:12:12.920 --> 00:12:18.210
This is trespassing. If you do not want the police to come, then leave here immediately.

00:12:18.210 --> 00:12:22.410
I'm Amano Ichigo. I'm Kashino Makoto-kun's classmate!

00:12:22.410 --> 00:12:23.630
Leave.

00:12:23.630 --> 00:12:27.220
He's here, isn't he!? Please give us Kashino-kun back!

00:12:27.220 --> 00:12:33.230
I work for the Kashino family. I cannot let those without permission pass.

00:12:33.230 --> 00:12:38.440
Kashino is our friend! We can't just shut up and watch when our friend is being taken away!

00:12:44.950 --> 00:12:48.050
Why can't you listen to me?

00:12:48.050 --> 00:12:54.290
Even if you become a pâtissier, nobody will cheer you on. If you become a doctor, Father and the others will accept you.

00:12:54.290 --> 00:12:58.700
At this rate, you'll be all alone. Are you okay with that?

00:12:58.700 --> 00:13:00.000
I...

00:13:00.430 --> 00:13:01.500
Kashino!

00:13:02.100 --> 00:13:05.610
H-He's tied up! Why?

00:13:05.610 --> 00:13:09.260
That way, we can talk nice and slow, right?

00:13:10.810 --> 00:13:13.220
That person's serious, right..?

00:13:13.220 --> 00:13:15.890
She's more extreme than Kashino, she's a Super Sadist.

00:13:15.890 --> 00:13:18.590
Muraoka, who are these kids?

00:13:18.590 --> 00:13:21.000
They say they are classmates of Makoto-sama.

00:13:21.000 --> 00:13:23.610
Why did you let them through without my permission?

00:13:23.610 --> 00:13:25.110
I made a decision myself.

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:30.780
So you're his sister. Please give us Kashino back!

00:13:30.780 --> 00:13:34.480
We're in the same group, so if he's not there then we'll be in trouble!

00:13:34.480 --> 00:13:37.050
There's an important final tomorrow!

00:13:37.050 --> 00:13:38.770
Oh, really?

00:13:38.770 --> 00:13:45.760
Then, if I don't give Makoto back then he'll be absent for the test. He won't be the top student so he will have to leave.

00:13:46.850 --> 00:13:54.590
No matter how much you try, you can't become a pâtissier. So the quicker you get kicked out, the better it'll be for you.

00:13:54.590 --> 00:13:57.140
Onee-san, please eat our cake!

00:13:57.140 --> 00:13:58.210
Hm?

00:13:58.210 --> 00:14:01.930
We'll make a cake with Kashino!

00:14:01.930 --> 00:14:05.640
If you eat it and like it, then please give us Kashino back!

00:14:07.150 --> 00:14:08.480
N-No way-!

00:14:09.290 --> 00:14:11.910
All right, that's fine.

00:14:11.910 --> 00:14:17.580
If that cake doesn't match my tastes, then I'll make my brother quit the St. Marie Academy immediately.

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:18.960
All right.

00:14:20.380 --> 00:14:23.920
I'll be waiting in my room. Muraoka, I'll leave the rest to you.

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:24.670
Yes'm.

00:14:26.670 --> 00:14:30.130
Kashino, are you okay? I'll untie you right now.

00:14:31.650 --> 00:14:36.520
You total nitwit! She rates food extremely harshly, and dislikes a lot of foods!

00:14:36.520 --> 00:14:41.690
Who in the world would say something is delicious when they're against it in the first place!?

00:14:41.960 --> 00:14:43.110
Is that so?

00:14:43.110 --> 00:14:44.320
It is so!

00:14:44.320 --> 00:14:47.820
Well, she is that much of a sadist so it's possible.

00:14:47.820 --> 00:14:52.260
W-What should we do? Oh, should we run away right now?

00:14:52.260 --> 00:14:55.030
No, Muraoka's watching us.

00:14:55.710 --> 00:14:59.850
We can't argue about it any more.
Now, we've just got to do it.

00:14:59.850 --> 00:15:02.880
So, what kind of sweets should we make?

00:15:04.840 --> 00:15:08.250
We need to give her a nice smack!

00:15:08.250 --> 00:15:12.010
Hmm, how could we get her to enjoy it?

00:15:12.010 --> 00:15:16.100
Huh!? Why do we have to let her enjoy it!?

00:15:16.560 --> 00:15:21.230
Well, aren't the sweets we make made to be enjoyable to the people eating it?

00:15:22.110 --> 00:15:24.420
Ichigo-chan's totally right.

00:15:24.420 --> 00:15:27.400
We can't forget a pâtissier's virtues.

00:15:28.530 --> 00:15:36.740
We don't know your sister well, so you pick what we'll make, Kashino. You know about your sister well, right?

00:15:38.670 --> 00:15:39.750
The opera.

00:15:47.510 --> 00:15:50.050
What kind of a sweets is an opera?

00:15:50.390 --> 00:15:55.720
It's a coffee-scented chocolate cake. It's a really difficult cake which requires a ton of skill to make.

00:15:57.110 --> 00:15:58.510
Here, Kashino.

00:15:58.510 --> 00:16:00.530
Chocolat, you saved me.

00:16:00.530 --> 00:16:00.930
Eh?

00:16:00.930 --> 00:16:03.650
Thanks for bringing them here.

00:16:04.820 --> 00:16:06.650
You're very welcome!

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:17.160
Now we just cool it and decorate.

00:16:17.160 --> 00:16:18.950
Careful, Ichigo.

00:16:18.950 --> 00:16:19.870
Mhm.

00:16:20.160 --> 00:16:22.650
Hey, what were her results?

00:16:22.650 --> 00:16:25.150
It's all right, nothing was wrong.

00:16:25.150 --> 00:16:26.170
Okay.

00:16:26.170 --> 00:16:29.210
Hey Kashino, why'd you choose Opera?

00:16:30.260 --> 00:16:31.210
Oh...

00:16:43.110 --> 00:16:45.850
Miyabi-sama, I've brought the sweets.

00:16:46.320 --> 00:16:47.440
Just a second.

00:16:53.450 --> 00:16:54.570
Come in.

00:17:00.750 --> 00:17:01.910
So you made it.

00:17:01.910 --> 00:17:02.870
Yeah.

00:17:06.590 --> 00:17:08.290
Oh, it's an Opera.

00:17:08.840 --> 00:17:11.960
I'm a little picky about Opera.

00:17:12.560 --> 00:17:15.840
After all, I've eaten Operas from many stores.

00:17:15.840 --> 00:17:17.470
That's why we chose Opera.

00:17:17.470 --> 00:17:18.010
Eh?

00:17:18.350 --> 00:17:23.250
Kashino-kun chose to make the cake that his sister loves the most.

00:17:23.250 --> 00:17:25.690
Please, have a bite.

00:17:27.320 --> 00:17:30.850
Also, when you're tired, chocolate is good for you.

00:17:30.850 --> 00:17:34.440
We think your sleepiness will go away as well with the scent of the coffee essence.

00:17:34.990 --> 00:17:37.440
It's tough studying to be a doctor, isn't it?

00:17:38.410 --> 00:17:40.160
I'm not, really...

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:43.410
I can tell even if you hide it. We're siblings.

00:17:45.710 --> 00:17:49.950
Eat up. It's better cold.

00:17:49.950 --> 00:17:51.730
Miyabi-sama, here you are.

00:17:52.180 --> 00:17:53.300
I'll have a bite.

00:18:02.720 --> 00:18:06.390
Please, say it's yummy!

00:18:08.490 --> 00:18:12.110
Hey Makoto... Do you remember when you were little?

00:18:12.110 --> 00:18:13.020
Eh..?

00:18:13.490 --> 00:18:19.930
Since Father and Mother both wouldn't be home often, you were lonely and always crying.

00:18:19.930 --> 00:18:21.450
Really~

00:18:21.450 --> 00:18:23.110
It's about when I was little!

00:18:23.630 --> 00:18:32.860
When you cried, it was tough on me, too... that's why I always played with you, so you wouldn't cry.

00:18:32.860 --> 00:18:38.550
I had always thought, "I need to protect my crybaby brother".

00:18:38.980 --> 00:18:48.200
But before I knew it, you had found your own path, and your own friends, and had grown so much so quickly.

00:18:48.200 --> 00:18:49.060
Onee-san...

00:18:49.490 --> 00:18:53.020
I've eaten pricey Operas at many fancy places.

00:18:53.530 --> 00:18:57.620
But, this is the first Opera I've had with such a gentle taste.

00:18:57.620 --> 00:18:58.490
That means..!

00:18:59.080 --> 00:19:02.990
Thank you for the dessert. It was absolutely delicious.

00:19:02.990 --> 00:19:04.160
Yes!

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:05.490
We did it, Kashino!

00:19:05.490 --> 00:19:06.620
Good for you, Ma-kun!

00:19:06.620 --> 00:19:08.500
I want to eat it too!

00:19:10.420 --> 00:19:15.000
Queen, it's a cake full of memories! Please take it!

00:19:19.600 --> 00:19:22.740
Makoto, take care of yourself.

00:19:22.740 --> 00:19:28.470
Sorry. Since I left the house, I put more pressure on you, si-

00:19:30.030 --> 00:19:33.220
I'm not so soft that you'd need to worry about me.

00:19:33.220 --> 00:19:36.480
Studying to be a doctor is hard, but it's interesting.

00:19:37.160 --> 00:19:40.440
Besides, I have an ally as well.

00:19:40.440 --> 00:19:41.640
Huh?

00:19:42.160 --> 00:19:45.160
Right? Future husband?

00:19:45.160 --> 00:19:45.990
Eh!?

00:19:45.990 --> 00:19:51.650
Y-Yes! I will protect Miyabi-sama for the rest of my life, not as my job, but as her man!

00:19:52.470 --> 00:19:55.320
They'll probably go against it, but I won't lose.

00:19:55.320 --> 00:20:00.800
I will work hard to get my own happiness. Just like you.

00:20:00.800 --> 00:20:01.750
Yup!

00:20:02.230 --> 00:20:08.390
Onee-san! We'll work on our skills at making sweets in order to make you a wedding cake!

00:20:08.390 --> 00:20:10.850
Yeah. I'll be looking forward to it.

00:20:10.850 --> 00:20:13.940
Your sister really seemed to enjoy it!

00:20:10.870 --> 00:20:13.560
Mori01

