Matsuo Pass - Okabayashi Village

00:20:13.940 --> 00:20:17.570
Hey, how about making a cake for your mother and father?

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:21.610
If they like it, they might let you keep on your dream of becoming a pâtissier!

00:20:21.610 --> 00:20:22.860
They won't eat it.

00:20:22.860 --> 00:20:23.280
Huh?

00:20:23.280 --> 00:20:30.290
They won't even touch a dessert that I made, yet still try to crush my dreams. That's the kind of parents that they are.

00:20:30.290 --> 00:20:31.790
How could they...

00:20:31.790 --> 00:20:33.160
But I don't care!

00:20:33.160 --> 00:20:33.790
Huh?

00:20:33.790 --> 00:20:39.710
If I keep being at the top at St. Marie's, and win the Grand Prix, then I get to study in Paris.

00:20:40.300 --> 00:20:42.470
Then it's all me.

00:20:42.470 --> 00:20:45.010
I won't let anyone get in the way of my dream!

00:20:45.600 --> 00:20:47.720
Yeah, let's do this together!

00:20:47.720 --> 00:20:49.850
The more obstacles you have, the harder you work!

00:20:49.850 --> 00:20:52.100
First up is tomorrow's final!

00:20:52.100 --> 00:20:53.230
Test?

00:20:53.230 --> 00:20:54.730
Ah! I forgot all about it!

00:20:55.000 --> 00:20:57.300
There's still tonight.

00:20:57.300 --> 00:21:01.400
I'll slam the important points into your head until morning, so prepare yourself.

